    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handstand Hank is a punishing experience that will test your patience while you attempt to traverse your way up a mountain of obstacles. <i>Jump</i>, <i>Fall</i> and <i>Rage</i>\u00a0your way through  increasingly difficult challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308150/extras/4e0ca010483a12037bfd49dd49d5f8e7.poster.avif?t=1750490610\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308150/extras/4e0ca010483a12037bfd49dd49d5f8e7.webm?t=1750490610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308150/extras/4e0ca010483a12037bfd49dd49d5f8e7.mp4?t=1750490610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get Ready for a Challenge:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 brutality difficult areas - Each one introduces new, unique challenges to overcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two ways to play - <i>Easy Mode</i> with checkpoints or <i>Hard Mode</i> where each fall is costly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unmatched triumph awaits those who reach the top.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308150/extras/ea9e5dc654ba3fd6cd209891e6ad51ab.webp?t=1750490610\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308150/extras/95a52ae14beb06068e42a5a38e104688.poster.avif?t=1750490610\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308150/extras/95a52ae14beb06068e42a5a38e104688.webm?t=1750490610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308150/extras/95a52ae14beb06068e42a5a38e104688.mp4?t=1750490610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
